---
const points = [
  "We absorb the diagnostic and verification cost",
  "Metered baseline before any work begins, read at the service entrance",
  "Savings verified on site, normalized for occupancy and weather",
  "You decide after you've seen the number, not before",
];
---

<section class="section guarantee" id="guarantee" aria-labelledby="guarantee-title">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="guarantee__card reveal">
      <span class="guarantee__badge" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
          <path
            d="M10 1.5 3 4.2v5.1c0 4 2.9 7 7 9.2 4.1-2.2 7-5.2 7-9.2V4.2L10 1.5Z"
            stroke="var(--mint)"
            stroke-width="1.4"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
          <path
            d="m6.8 9.8 2.2 2.2 4.2-4.5"
            stroke="var(--mint)"
            stroke-width="1.6"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </svg>
      </span>

      <p class="guarantee__label">The risk reversal</p>
      <h2 class="guarantee__title" id="guarantee-title">
        We pay to find out whether we can help you, before you pay us anything.
      </h2>
      <p class="guarantee__body">
        We absorb the cost of the diagnosis and the verification ourselves. We
        meter your building, establish a baseline, and prove the floor at your
        service entrance before a single thing is installed. If the verified
        floor isn't there, there is nothing to commit to and you owe us nothing
        for finding out.
      </p>
      <p class="guarantee__body">
        No vendor selling a box would ever pay to discover they can't help you.
        We do, because we're not selling a box. We're selling the truth about
        your building, and we're confident enough in the diagnosis to fund it
        ourselves.
      </p>

      <ul class="guarantee__points">
        {points.map((p) => <li>{p}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .guarantee {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .guarantee__card {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        ellipse 80% 100% at 0% 0%,
        var(--mint-soft),
        transparent 60%
      ),
      var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid rgba(70, 179, 146, 0.35);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 70px -50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
  }
  .guarantee__badge {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 46px;
    height: 46px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(70, 179, 146, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(70, 179, 146, 0.3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-m);
  }
  .guarantee__label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mint);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .guarantee__title {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    max-width: 20ch;
  }
  .guarantee__body {
    margin-top: var(--space-m);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--body);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .guarantee__points {
    margin-top: var(--space-l);
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-s);
  }
  .guarantee__points li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.9rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
  }
  .guarantee__points li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.45em;
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--mint);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--mint-soft);
  }
</style>
